msgid ""
"*Erle-Brain 2*: The new generation of artificial robotic brains for drones "
"and robots that use DroneCode Foundation Tools, ROS and many other tools."
msgstr "*Erle-Brain 2*：新一代无人机和机器人人工智能大脑，使用 DroneCode 基金会工具、ROS 及其他许多工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain-linux-autopilot.rst:13
