msgstr "Erle-Brain 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain-linux-autopilot.rst:24
#: 318e477bda2946e099f6666f94e7a906 582d9eea7afe4f688fa1ccb35cd5c13c
#: 5dab1f8d3fe7420b9b552300acafcf4c 79ae3c263e594280b53eff9c9d09056e
#: f212b9103947410ead5c0fe421185c4c fc14249c08a041cda6d851ef4e161b0a
msgid ""
"`Erle-Brain 2 <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/erle-brain-v2/>`__ is "
"the second generation of Linux-based artificial robotic brain for making "
"robots and drones with official support for the Robot Operating System (ROS)"
" and access to the app store."
msgstr ""
"`Erle-Brain 2 <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/erle-brain-v2/>`__ "
"是第二代基于 Linux 的机器人智能大脑，用于制造机器人和无人机，官方支持机器人操作系统（ROS）并可访问应用商店。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain-linux-autopilot.rst:29
#: 5002272c4de043bd83ae2e0a3864de9e 672a9763541447eca9160a908a5e9097
#: 9381717f4eec4d289a6632bd380c666b c2d2240dfbd9471c8bc672f1a548c5f3
#: dc1181acc7ee453a9001e2110fe497a1 e806bbc3199249c09daf87fe57cf7d33
msgid ""
"It combines an embedded Linux computer (Raspberry Pi 2) and a daughter board"
" containing several sensors, IO and power electronics. It is a Linux "
"embedded device that runs ArduPilot as well many other frameworks and "
"services for robotic application development."
msgstr ""
"它将嵌入式 Linux 计算机（Raspberry Pi 2）与含多种传感器、IO 和电源电子元件的子板相结合。它是一款运行 ArduPilot "
"以及众多机器人应用开发框架和服务的 Linux 嵌入式设备。"

