#: d02ffe4c1b2845ec9e8d035bb6e5dacc e2049d4d22cd4b5cb6e690d2129d9c9d
msgid ""
"Snappy Ubuntu Core is a new rendition of Ubuntu with transactional updates -"
" a minimal server image with the same libraries as today’s Ubuntu, but "
"applications are provided through a simpler mechanism. The snappy approach "
"is faster, more reliable, and lets us provide stronger security guarantees "
"for apps and users — that’s why we call them “snappy” applications."
msgstr ""
"Snappy Ubuntu Core 是 Ubuntu 的全新形态，采用事务性更新——与当前 Ubuntu "
"使用相同库的最小服务器镜像，但通过更简单的机制提供应用程序。Snappy "
"方式更快、更可靠，并允许我们为应用和用户提供更强的安全保障——这就是我们称之为「snappy」应用的原因。"

